# Scientific Collaboration Network Analyzer

Research collaboration management platform to manage publications, researchers,
institutions, projects, conferences, and collaborations.

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic
- Database: PostgreSQL, Redis
- Frontend: React (Vite)
- Auth: JWT
- Deployment: Docker

## Setup (VSCode)

### Backend
```
cd backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
source venv/bin/activate   # Mac/Linux
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
API docs available at http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

### Frontend
```
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Docker (all services together)
```
docker-compose up --build
```

## Project Structure
See folder layout: backend/app/{models,schemas,routers,services,core,utils},
frontend/src/{pages,components,api}.

## Modules
1. User Management
2. Researcher Management
3. Publication Management
4. Collaboration Management
5. Conference Management
6. Citation & Reference
7. Dashboard
8. Reports & Export
9. Audit Module
